# Local secrets for `uv run pywrangler dev`.
#
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in. In production these are set with
#   uv run pywrangler secret put LLM_API_KEY
# and never live in a file.
#
# Two things to know about `.dev.vars`:
#   * If `.dev.vars` exists, `.env` is ignored entirely — do not create both.
#   * A `.dev.vars` file must contain ALL secrets for its environment; there is
#     no merging with a base file. Per-environment variants are
#     `.dev.vars.<environment-name>`.
#
# Non-secret configuration (LLM_BASE_URL, LLM_MODEL, CHANNEL_FEED_URL, ...) lives
# in `wrangler.jsonc` under `vars`, not here.

LLM_API_KEY="sk-replace-me"
